# The ONNX Runtime DLL is 14MB and identical for everyone, so it is fetched per
# machine by fetch-models.ps1. Both models are committed: YuNet is 227KB and
# u2netp 4.4MB, small enough that pinning their exact contents in git is worth
# more than the space saved.
/runtime/*.dll

